0..75 Comment "// What `univalence`\'s owed laws need and the checker does not have (#520)."
76..154 Comment "// `ua` after `idtoequiv` is the path once `J` reaches reflexivity, where `ua`"
155..229 Comment "// of the identity record is not reflexivity: two paths between types that"
230..308 Comment "// transport alike are not one path. `idtoequiv` after `ua` is the record once"
309..387 Comment "// its inverses are determined by its map, which needs function extensionality"
388..464 Comment "// from a homotopy at any two functions; `funext` decides closed first-order"
465..507 Comment "// functions only, and `ua` gives the rest"
508..557 Comment "// (`../../model/identity/funext-from-ua.gandr`)."
559..609 Comment "// Univalence over the user universe: `idtoequiv`."
